BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Havana Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T233000
UID:260609XOP1Q7Ay406eotQa3DyGnQ
DESCRIPTION:Let’s enjoy Havana SALSA Night! Think vibrant colors\, tro
 pical prints\, fedoras\, linen shirts\, and elegant summer dresses. Let’
 s make the room look as spectacular as the music sounds.\n\nGet Ready for 
 Havana Nights!\n\nMark Your Calendars \\(Summer Series\\)\n\nFriday\, June
  12 Friday\, July 10 Friday\, August 7\n\nTime: Dancing starts at 8:30 P
 M\n\nTwo Rooms\, Double the Flavor\n\nWhy settle for one style when you ca
 n have both? We are featuring two dedicated rooms all night long:\n\nThe S
 alsa Room: Pure\, high-energy salsa and timba to keep you spinning.\n\nTh
 e Bachata Room: Smooth\, sensual\, and modern bachata beats for your favo
 rite partner dances.\n\nFREE IF YOU TAKE CLASS THAT DAY\n\n$10 early bird\
 n\n$15 at the door.\n\nParty Details\n\nTheme: Havana Night! Think vibra
 nt colors\, tropical prints\, fedoras\, linen shirts\, and elegant summer 
 dresses. Let’s make the room look as spectacular as the music sounds.\n\
