 xpression through painting\, sculpture\, ceramics\, jewelry\, photography\
 , textiles\, and handcrafted goods. Guests can enjoy live music performanc
 es throughout the day\, browse unique artwork\, savor local food and bever
 ages\, and experience the welcoming spirit of Sonoma. Perfect for families
