 This year's theme is "Cotati Kids Dig Into Fun!" so bring the whole family
  down to this fun and exciting event! Costumes encouraged. The parade star
 ts at 10:00 AM at the Cotati City Hall. Folks will wind their way through 
 downtown Cotati to La Plaza Park where parade judges and the festival awai
 t. Schedule for the day \\(subject to change\\): 8:00 AM - 10:00 AM: FREE 
