 king our historic\, family-farmed vineyards and golden-hour views.\n\nSett
 le in for a laid-back yet elevated wine country experience featuring live 
 music by Dustin Saylor\, Dutton Estate wines grown right here on the ranch
 \, and classic barbecue inspired by the season. Add a little Western flair
  to your evening by creating your own custom hat at the Bosworth Hat Bar p
 erfect for sipping in style.\n\nWhether you’re a wine club member or joi
 ning us for the first time\, we invite you to kick back\, connect\, and ce
