BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Music of Joni Mitchell: From Folk to Jazz
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T150000
UID:260709xPyRBcHKGUiHrtUHFvGfDw
DESCRIPTION:Joni MItchell is the epitome of the singer/songwriter. From in
 nocent hippie ballads to recent prophetic social commentary\, her lyrics a
 re poetry set to emotionally complex harmonizations. From folk to jazz her
  compositions are examples of modern day art songs. Kate Foley-Beining\, b
 acked by a trio of Sonoma County jazz greats\, will add dulcimer\, guitar\
