DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T000000
UID:2606144WY4nt-tGk-zb15eTglZWg
DESCRIPTION:Visit Sonoma County's biggest market hosted at the Old Courtho
 use Square in downtown Santa Rosa! Shop from 80\\+ small businesses: Vinta
 ge clothing Jewelry Local makers Candles Plants Food trucks And MOREE! Vib
 e to music and enjoy the overall lively atmosphere! FREE ADMISSION // FAMI
 LY \\+ PET FRIENDLY Public metered parking available nearby \\(free parkin
 g after 6pm & all day Sunday\\). Closest parking garage located on 3rd str
 eet- walking distance to Old Courthouse Square. Free parking available at 
 the Santa Rosa Plaza mall- about a 5-7 min walk to the Old Courthouse Squa
 re!
