DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260712T160000
UID:26070991RiGKft9kK-EvVeG7GVxQ
DESCRIPTION:Meet\, greet\, commune and make art from the heart at Emmanuel
  Farmstead. Our uniquely curated family friendly crafts and activities nur
