DESCRIPTION:Paris is calling\, and it's right here in Healdsburg! On Tuesd
 ay\, July 14th\, join us at Costeaux as we celebrate Bastille Day with an 
 evening designed around exceptional French bistro dining and live entertai
 nment. Indulge in your favorite dinner dishes and clever holiday specials 
 by Chef Jorge Flores while enjoying a variety of live entertainment! Table
 s will book up fast for this beloved community tradition. Don't miss out o
 n an unforgettable evening out! Reservations open at 4:00 p.m.
