 ear-old boy\, Hogarth\, discovers the robot and soon forms an unlikely fri
 endship with him. When a paranoid government agent\, Kent Mansley\, become
 s determined to destroy the robot\, Hogarth and beatnik Dean McCoppin must
  do what they can to save the misunderstood machine. Released Aug 4\, 1999
  Rated PG \\(Mild Language|Fantasy Action Kids & Family\, Adventure\, Fant
 asy\, Action\, Animation Runtime 1h 26m.   Assistive listening devices ava
 ilable
