BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Thursday Night Live at Priest Ranch | Yountville
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260716T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260716T210000
UID:26050467lDk7rKZkGt6jBJifIC6g
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Thursday Night Live series—an ongoing
  celebration of great music\, good wine\, and easy Napa Valley evenings. T
 hroughout the season\, we’ll feature a rotating lineup of talented local
  and regional artists spanning a variety of genres.\n\nAdmission is compli
 mentary\, and seating is first-come\, first-served—so come early\, grab 
 your spot\, and settle in for the night. Enjoy your favorite Priest Ranch 
 wines available by the glass or bottle\, along with a special menu from Th
 e Kitchen crafted just for the occasion. Whether you’re winding down aft
 er work or gathering friends for a casual night out\, Thursday Night Live 
 is your standing invitation to sip\, savor\, and soak in the sounds.\n\nMu
 sic is complimentary. Wine and food are available to purchase. No reservat
 ion required.\n\n**July 9** — Carlos Ramirez Trio (Latin)\n\n**July 16**
  — David Ronconi Trio (Alternative)\n\n**July 23** — Sticky Bandits (C
 overs)\n\n**July 30** — Complicated Animals (Indie Nova)\n\n**August 6**
  — Radio Bobcat (Indie)\n\n**August 13** — Big Blu Soul Revue (Soul)\n
 \n**August 20** — Lilan Kane (Soul)\n\n**August 27** — Sean Carscaden 
 (Rock)\n\n**September 10** — Edgardo y Candela (Latin)\n\n**September 17
 ** — Steady Eddy & The Shakers (Motown)
LOCATION:Priest Ranch Tasting Room
URL:https://priestranchwines.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260716T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260716T170000
UID:260430MH8iSB-b8kSpHb0Pt-861w
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
