DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 14th annual Northern California yarn lovers ex
 perience from July 17-19\, 2026!\n\nThe Wine Country Yarn Hop consists of 
 5 shops located in the beautiful Wine Country between Petaluma & Ukiah.\n\
 nThe 2026 Yarn Hop is FREE and begins July 17\, 2026 at 10:00am. The Hop i
 s 3 days long\, you can choose to do all 5 shops in one day\, or spread it
  out and hop all weekend.\n\nAll 5 shops are open from 10:00 - 5:00 each d
 ay of the Hop: July 17\, 18 & 19.\n\nYou will receive a passport to be sta
 mped at each shop\, as well as 1 raffle ticket per stop. Participants will
  be entered to win a prize basket at each shop\, AND the Grand Prize baske
 t when a complete passport is turned in. FREE patterns\, and free enamel p
 ins w/ tote or lanyard purchase.\n\nNo need to register - just start hoppi
 ng at any of the 5 shops!\n\nLearn more: winecountryyarnhop.com\n\nPartici
 pating Shops:\n\nFiber Circle Studios- Petaluma\n\nNoma Knits- Sonoma \n\
 nCast Away Yarn Shop- Santa Rosa\n\nPurls of Joy- Healdsburg\n\nPurple Nee
 dle- Ukiah
