SUMMARY:Kalei Yamanoha & The Sam Chase Trio
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T193000
UID:260628a1m7elhNWUuQGEEtlABNqw
DESCRIPTION:$25 General Admission\n\nDoors at 7:30pm.\n\nShow from 8:15-10
 :30pm with one intermission\n\nEarlybirds!\n\n$3 off each ticket when you 
 use the code earlybird2 at checkout. Offer ends July 12th.\n\nPromo Co
 des are not applicable at the door.\n\nCodes are not case sensitive\, bu
 t must be typed as one word.\n\nKalei Yamanoha has been a musical explore
 r since childhood\, learning traditional Hawaiian music with his father an
 d expanding to play in dozens of projects across the United States and bey
 ond. A multi-instrumentalist equally at home on guitar\, accordion\, banjo
 \, steel guitar\, brass and more\, Kalei deploys his broad musical vocabul
 ary in service of songs that grow from tradition\, travel\, and curiosity.
  Over years of touring\, collaborating\, recording\, and teaching\, he’s
  developed a sound that feels rooted yet fluid\, honoring Hawai’i while 
 welcoming influences from around the world.\n\nwww.kaleiyamanoha.com\n\nht
 tps://www.instagram.com/kaleiyamanohamusic\n\nTHE SAM CHASE TRIO\, also kn
 own as “The God Particle Of Music\,” by all who have hypothesized of h
 is existence before his discovery 10 years ago\, eminent singer-songwriter
  The Sam Chase strides out of the hadron collider flanked on one side by C
 handra Johnson\, violin heroine\, and on the other by Devon McClive\, reno
 wned and feared cellist at large.   Their songs matter to the masses in t
 he same way that the Higgs boson gives mass to all matter.  Their music i
 s the Big Bang to a universe of sound.\n\nSome say that their music has th
 e potential to destroy the universe\, but it is a risk that we should be w
 illing to take. This is what you get when deftly bowed strings collide wit
 h ironclad songwriting. This is the pure distillation of adventure and hea
 rtache of American song.  https://thesamchase.com/ https://www.instagram.
 com/thesamchase/ https://www.instagram.com/chanjohnson/ https://www.instag
 ram.com/devonmcclive/
LOCATION:The Lost Church Santa Rosa
URL:https://thelostchurch.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket#/instances/a0FUh0
 00007tTIHMA2
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:One Tam Guided Hike Series - "Rooted In The Watershed"
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T130000
UID:260626ayzjMU2_L0Owv6zmEmeXPQ
DESCRIPTION:Join One Tam staff for our summer Rooted in the Watershed guid
 ed hike series\, where we travel from peak to Pacific through the forests
  of Marin County. Starting on Mt. Tamalpais\, we will follow the water all
  the way out to Lagunitas Creek\, stopping at several forest types on the
  way. This series encourages folks to reflect upon how our parks are conne
 cted through the watershed they share\, and how\, through collaborative ma
 nagement\, we can foster more resilient landscapes. \n\nFollow the link t
 o our google sign up form. There\, you can read more about the events in m
 ore detail and get your name on the sign up. We will reach out a couple w
 eeks before your hike to provide more logistics about specific locatio
 n\, parking\, and trail distance. \n\nWe hope you will join us!
LOCATION:Mt. Tamalpais
URL:https://forms.gle/bvqegQYdpbvLwqncA
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hal Sparks! Friday Night Comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T220000
UID:260624kvf4dTF99k6VkBLmaGJ2tg
DESCRIPTION:Hal Sparks comes to Downtown Santa Rosa!\n\nVIP TABLES NOW AVA
 ILABLE! Snag a table for 4 with preferred seating\, your own private call 
 button to summon service\, and your first round of beer/cider (or a bottle
  of wine) for only $149!\n\nEvery Friday night hilarious comedians from Th
 e Bay Area and beyond perform at Barrel Proof Lounge. Stick around after f
 or late-night karaoke! Fresh lineup of funny each Friday.\n\nThis Week: Jo
 n Lehre (host) Jeff Klein Headliner: Hal Sparks\n\nHal Sparks is a stand-u
 p comedian\, actor\, musician\, political commentator\, television and rad
 io host and television personality. You know him from his stand-up special
 s as well as his appearances on Queer As Folk \, Talk Soup and more.\n\nAc
 tor/comedian Hal Sparks began his professional career as a teenager in Chi
 cago. As a member of the famed Second City Troupe\, his quick wit and affa
 ble personality quickly gained him recognition and acclaim. In 1987 he was
  named the “Funniest Teenager in Chicago” by The Chicago Sun Times .\n
 \nAfter a successful run with Second City\, Sparks moved to Los Angeles an
 d immediately began performing at numerous comedy clubs\, including The Im
 prov\, The Comedy Store\, The Laugh Factory\, and The Ice House\, as well 
 as at Comic Relief’s American Comedy Festival.\n\nFrom 1999–2000\, Spa
 rks was the host of the Emmy-award winning Talk Soup on E! Entertainment T
 elevision\, winning rave reviews from fans and critics alike. For five sea
 sons\, he co-starred as “Michael Novotny” on the hit Showtime series Q
 ueer as Folk \, based on the controversial and critically acclaimed Britis
 h series. He also starred in his one Showtime stand-up comedy special\, Ch
 armageddon \, in June 2010.\n\nHis numerous television appearances include
  The Tonight Show \, Larry King Live \, Charlie Rose \, Good Morning Ameri
 ca \, The View \, CNN’s Your Money \, Joy Behar \, Politically Incorrect
  \, MTV\, and Jimmy Kimmel Live .\n\n21+ Doors - 7p / Show - 8p $15adv / $
 20door Check out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times
  ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/hal-sparks-friday-night-comedy-in-downtow
 n-santa-rosa-tickets-1992182303899?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
