 able Soft Curse. We’re honored to have them join on the bill as we antic
 ipate they won’t be playing many more opening sets. Prepare for Gloom Me
 tal.  In between sets we have DJ Hypatia \\(Chris\\) spinning the finest c
 hoice cuts on wax.  We will be selling our new album Cosmic Dawn on limite
 d edition Pink Lemonade splatter vinyl\, on CD\, and we will be release 3 
