  music\, good vibes\, and a great excuse to make a Sunday out of it.\n\nSu
 mmer Sundays Music Series is a free monthly event bringing live music to t
 he Courtyard at Montgomery Village all summer long. This year\, we’re fe
 aturing local saxophonist Jimmy Galvan\, whose sound sets the perfect back
 drop for a relaxed afternoon in the heart of Sonoma County. Come for the m
 usic\, stay for the shopping\, dining\, coffee and ice cream. No tickets\,
  no fuss\, just a great community afternoon.\n\nJoin us on Sunday\, July 1
 9th from 12–2pm in the Courtyard at Montgomery Village (located near Mon
 ti’s\, Salt & Straw and Anthropologie). We invite you to grab a bite or 
 treat from your favorite Village restaurant or cafe\, then settle into the
  Courtyard and enjoy the sounds of summer. Summer Sundays are free and ope
 n to the community.
