DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T120000
UID:2606064pfkN5B3vkiqfN8HYtpXZg
DESCRIPTION:Bring the whole family to the Sonoma Community Center for a fr
 ee outdoor concert filled with lively music\, arts and crafts\, and intera
 ctive fun for all ages. Designed to spark young imaginations\, this joyful
 \, wiggle-friendly performance invites children and families to experience
  classical music in an engaging and welcoming setting. Arrive early for ar
 ts and crafts activities. Concert duration: approximately 60 minutes with 
 no intermission. Outdoor event\; hats\, umbrellas\, and blankets encourage
 d.\n\nThe Valley of the Moon Music Festival returns July 11–26\, 2026\, 
 with Postcards from Dvořák\, a season inspired by the travels\, influenc
 es\, and cultural connections behind the composer’s music. Set in the he
 art of Sonoma Valley\, the festival brings together internationally acclai
 med musicians for historically informed performances that blend world-clas
 s classical music with the beauty and charm of wine country.
