  of the ones provided or get up and dance under the stars\, to all your fa
 vorite blues songs at Blues Night. Nearby Napa Yard will be offering beer\
 , craft cocktails\, and BBQ.\n\nAll the Not Loud Concerts focus on the bes
 t of what live music is about - casual fun without the crowds\, lines\, an
 d porta-potties of most summer shows. Clean bathrooms!\n\nNot Loud Concert
 s will be presenting a whole series of summer shows including:\n\nGilman J
 azz Festival - Berkeley - May 3\n\nVintage Rock Night - Napa - June 7\n\nB
