BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tea and Tarot: The Numberology in Tarot
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T140000
UID:260709PME_ZFePvU6sZz42Q3Pp3w
DESCRIPTION:Numbers are the hidden foundation of the tarot.\n\nEvery card 
 carries a numerical vibration that tells a story\, from the spark of the A
 ce to the completion of the Ten. By understanding the language of numbers\
 , you'll gain a deeper connection to the cards and strengthen your ability
  to interpret readings with confidence and clarity. In this Tea &amp\; Tar
 ot class\, we'll explore how numerology shapes the tarot and learn to reco
 gnize the patterns that repeat throughout the deck.\n\nIn This Class We Wi
 ll Explore:\n\n&bull\; The numerological meanings of numbers 1&ndash\;10\n
 \n&bull\; How numbers create the progression of the Minor Arcana\n\n&bull\
 ; Repeating themes across the suits\n\n&bull\; The relationship between ta
 rot symbolism and numerological energy\n\n&bull\; How numerology can deepe
 n your tarot interpretations\n\n&bull\; Practical exercises for recognizin
 g numerical patterns in readings\n\nWhether you're new to tarot or have be
 en reading for years\, understanding numerology can transform the way you 
 see the cards and reveal deeper layers of meaning.\n\nPerfect For:\n\n&bul
 l\; Tarot beginners\n\n&bull\; Intermediate readers wanting to deepen thei
 r practice\n\n&bull\; Students interested in symbolism and esoteric tradit
 ions\n\n&bull\; Anyone curious about the connection between numbers and in
 tuition\n\nSip tea\, explore the cards\, and discover the numerical patter
 ns woven throughout the tarot. ✨\n\nThis version feels much more aligned
  with your &ldquo\;Back to Basics&rdquo\; teaching style and keeps the emp
 hasis on tarot rather than general life-path numerology.
LOCATION:Songbird Community Healing Center
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/tea-and-tarot-the-numberol
 ogy-in-tarot?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
