DESCRIPTION:Join us for a dinner with Winemaker and Proprietor Kirk Venge\
 , alongside Travis Schimmer and Thomas Schwarting\, for an intimate evenin
 g featuring the wines of Croix Estate\, thoughtfully paired with a seasona
 l menu from Sea Ranch Lodge Executive Chef Ryan Seal.\n\nCroix Estate was 
 founded with a singular pursuit of perfection\, dedicated to crafting expr
 essive\, age-worthy wines that reflect the character and nuance of Sonoma 
 County’s most distinctive vineyard sites. Each wine in the lineup speaks
  to a site-driven philosophy\, shaped with precision\, restraint\, and a d
 eep respect for place.\n\nThroughout the evening\, guests will experience 
 these wines in conversation with the cuisine\, as Chef Ryan Seal presents 
 a carefully designed menu to highlight their structure\, elegance\, and co
 mplexity.\n\nA memorable evening of wine\, food\, and coastal beauty await
 s.
