 aterials Fee:\n\nIncluded\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$250\n\nJoin our 
 6-week acrylic painting course for beginners. Covers color mixing\, brush 
 techniques\, and composition across landscape and abstract styles.\n\nAbou
 t the Class\n\nThis six-week acrylic painting course is designed for begin
