BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Much Ado About Nothing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260723T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260723T193000
UID:260602sP6Q-NAPI02uM-BuD9rCSQ
DESCRIPTION:**It’s Shakespeare in the Piazza at Bacchus Landing**!\n\nWh
 ile Claudio and Hero fall in love and get engaged\, the villainous Don Joh
 n tricks Claudio into believing Hero is unfaithful\, leading him to public
 ly humiliate her at the altar. Meanwhile\, their friends conspire to make 
 the sparring Beatrice and Benedick fall in love\, and they eventually conf
 ess their feelings for each other. The play’s climax\, in pure Shakespea
 rean form\, involves a faked death\, a confession of Don John’s plot\, a
 nd a happy ending with a double wedding – of course!\n\nBacchus Landing
 ’s wood-fired pizza will be available for purchase\, and wine by the gla
 ss or bottle will also be available for purchase from selected wineries ea
 ch evening (see the schedule\, below). **Sorry\, no outside food or drink
  allowed except for water bottles.** Remember\, Sonoma County evenings ge
 t chilly even in the summer. We advise you to bring a sweater\, jacket\, o
 r hoodie in case you need to bundle up after sunset!\n\nJuly 23rd\, 24th\,
  25th\, 30th\, 31st\; August 1st\, 6th\, 7th. 7:30 pm.\n\nBy William Shake
 speare Directed by Steven David Martin Running time: 2:15 hours Doors open
  at 6:30 pm. **Come early to enjoy Bacchus Landing wood-fired pizza and s
 elect wines!** Free parking is available and the premises are wheelchair-a
 ccessible.
LOCATION:Bacchus Landing 
URL:https://raventheater.org/events/much-ado-about-nothing/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
