DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T203000
UID:260707NaLi1v2ND0KLVdAB6WXwng
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate summer at Frey Vineyards with the 4th Frey-Days Live
  Music - Bachanal Extravaganza! Enjoy an evening of live entertainment fea
 turing piano by Lars Brunner\, energetic Brazilian drumming\, a captivatin
 g belly dance performance by Joey Mayhugh\, and live guitar music from Cas
 sius Mayhugh. Guests can purchase Frey wines by the glass \\(21\\+\\)\, no
 n-alcoholic beverages\, and delicious fare from the Chico Rico food truck.
  This family-friendly event welcomes guests of all ages\, making it a fun 
 evening of music\, food\, and community in Mendocino wine country. Admissi
 on is free\, so bring your friends and enjoy an unforgettable night of liv
 e performances and great wine. Outside food and beverages are not permitte
 d.
