BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:One Tam Guided Hike Series - "Rooted In The Watershed"
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T130000
UID:260626nlOYFSGd3EK84MGDYn4DGw
DESCRIPTION:Join One Tam staff for our summer Rooted in the Watershed guid
 ed hike series\, where we travel from peak to Pacific through the forests
  of Marin County. Starting on Mt. Tamalpais\, we will follow the water all
  the way out to Lagunitas Creek\, stopping at several forest types on the
  way. This series encourages folks to reflect upon how our parks are conne
 cted through the watershed they share\, and how\, through collaborative ma
 nagement\, we can foster more resilient landscapes. \n\nFollow the link t
 o our google sign up form. There\, you can read more about the events in m
 ore detail and get your name on the sign up. We will reach out a couple w
 eeks before your hike to provide more logistics about specific locatio
 n\, parking\, and trail distance. \n\nWe hope you will join us!
LOCATION:Mt. Tamalpais
URL:https://forms.gle/bvqegQYdpbvLwqncA
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Scott Capurro is back at Barrel Proof • Friday 7/24 - Downtown S
 anta Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T220000
UID:260624o6KWuqOnkkmT9tXDVGjfvQ
DESCRIPTION:Friday night stand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nVIP TAB
 LES NOW AVAILABLE! Snag a table for 4 with preferred seating\, your own pr
 ivate call button to summon service\, and your first round of beer/cider (
 or a bottle of wine) for only $105!\n\nEvery Friday night hilarious comedi
 ans from The Bay Area and beyond perform at Barrel Proof Lounge. Stick aro
 und after for late-night karaoke! Fresh lineup of funny each Friday.\n\nTh
 is Week: host: Casey Williams Headliner: Scott Capurro\n\nScott Capurro wa
 s reared in San Francisco. At age 3\, he swam the English Channel. Since 1
 993\, he’s avoided AIDS by telling unsavory jokes in every English speak
 ing country. Scott is trusting and thus surrounded by duplicity\, yet he c
 ontinues challenging himself\, because he’s physically challenged and em
 otionally unavailable\, aka married.\n\nDescribed by San Francisco Weekly 
 (free press\, edited by lesbians and designed by trannys with large hands 
 and hidden agendas) as “stand-up in the very best possible sense – dea
 dpan\, ever-alert and hilarious”.\n\nScott has appeared in Mrs. Doubtfir
 e\, where\, effortlessly\, he played a homosexual\; and Star Wars: Phantom
  Menace\, where\, breathlessly\, he wore a body stocking. A gay designer w
 ho sports two heads might’ve been a predictable sequel\; instead Scott w
 addled off to the UK\, in search of a compassionate\, creative culture.\n\
 nDisappointed and slightly bloated\, Scott spends hours each day playing c
 lassical piano\, conversing in French and managing his meds. He knows (win
 k\, wink) several death row inmates and George Clooney. Well\, he met Geor
 ge once. They’re both vegetarians. Actually\, Scott is. Clooney said he 
 was\, to impress Scott. Guys on death row eat anything.\n\n21+ Doors - 7p 
 / Show - 8p $20adv / $25door\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** fo
 r all sorts of good times ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/scott-capurro-is-back-at-barrel-proof-fri
 day-724-downtown-santa-rosa-tickets-1991720934932?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
