 bastopol Subud Hall\, 234 Hutchins Ave.\, Sebastopol\n\nSirens Fest return
 s for three days of music\, dance\, culture\, and community. Friday featur
 es workshops in Oriental Bellydance\, Fusion\, Folkloric\, Dumbek\, Burles
 que\, and more. Saturday and Sunday offer nonstop performances\, live Egyp
 tian\, Turkish\, Kurdish\, Lebanese\, and Arabic music\, vendors\, Middle 
 Eastern food\, a full bar\, and a free Shisha tent (21+). Highlights inclu
 de Sirens After Dark Fire Show on Saturday and the Bellydancer of the Univ
 erse Regional Competition on Sunday. Festival hours vary by day. Admission
 : Saturday $30\, Sunday $25. For tickets and information visit www.sirens
 bellydancefest.com.
