 d educational event at **Montgomery Village in the Courtyard** hosted by
  Children’s Museum of Sonoma County on Saturday\, July 25th. Enjoy a m
 orning of hands-on\, engaging programming where kids will explore and lear
 n through play.\n\nThis event will take place at the Montgomery Village Co
 urtyard\, in the outdoor area in front of Cupcake Children’s Boutique an
 d Kaleidoscope Toys. Recommended for ages 4+. Space is limited\, please re
 serve your spot today.\n\nPlease note\, you are still responsible for supe
 rvising your children throughout the entire event.
