DESCRIPTION:Stratify is a 9pc. contemporary jazz band formed in 2012 by ba
 ssist and band leader Doc Robinson.  The plan for building this band came 
 together for Doc as he was preparing to retire from the military.  However
 \, the plan required bringing in the right musicians to make it work.  As 
 currently formed\, Stratify has been the best version of itself with stand
 out Bay Area musicians and a great family vibe\, all of which have been th
 e hallmark of Stratify.  The band performs uptempo\, funky groove instrume
 ntal\, vocal and smooth jazz tunes.  Our album "Smooth Your Mood\, Funk Yo
 ur Groove" featuring the songs "Change of Season"\, Switch \\(The Groove\\
 ) and our cover of Greg Adams "Survival of the Hippest"\, has received gre
 at reviews!  In addition to performing originals\, we perform covers of co
 ntemporary jazz greats such as Najee\, Grover Washington Jr.\, Pieces of a
  Dream\, Rick Braun\, Incognito\, Eliane Elias\, Sade and Brian Culbertson
  to name a few.
