UID:260707UNZSkYqfcEK6VIw2aEIZLQ
DESCRIPTION:Sandy's is a Bay Area band formed by singer-songwriter Alexi G
 lickman following the breakup of the acclaimed indie group The Botticellis
 . What began as a casual recording project evolved into a full band featur
 ing Burton Li\, Jeremy Black\, and Nick Aives\, blending surf rock\, indie
 \, jazz\, and melodic songwriting into a distinctive sound. Since releasin
 g their debut album Fourth Dementia in 2014\, Sandy's has continued to ref
 ine its signature style of shimmering guitars\, rich harmonies\, and atmos
 pheric arrangements. Their latest album\, Sound of the Bay\, was recorded 
 in Truckee and embraces an organic\, improvisational approach inspired by 
 collaboration and exploration. The result is an engaging collection of son
 gs that showcases the band's evolving surf-jazz influences and creative sp
 irit.
LOCATION:Little Saint
