BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cirque Kalabanté - World of Words at Luther Burbank
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T210000
UID:260707NP798wUVXE2-YmCoQhnhWA
DESCRIPTION:Experience the breathtaking artistry of Cirque Kalabanté - Wo
 rld of Words at the Luther Burbank Center for the Arts. Created by Yamouss
 a Bangoura\, this dynamic production celebrates the beauty\, culture\, and
  traditions of Guinea through extraordinary acrobatics\, vibrant storytell
 ing\, and live Afro-Jazz music. Featuring gravity-defying aerial performan
 ces\, human pyramids\, percussion\, and the melodic sounds of the kora\, t
 he show blends ancestral rituals with contemporary circus arts. World of W
 ords explores the power of shared knowledge\, cultural connection\, and mu
 tual respect\, creating an inspiring experience that bridges tradition and
  innovation. Filled with energy\, color\, and remarkable athleticism\, thi
 s unforgettable performance is a celebration of African artistry and the u
 niversal language of human connection.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/cirque-kalabante-world-of-words-at-luther
 -burbank-center/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
