BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Morning Flow: Pilates at Turnbull Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T123000
UID:260619awQUnG0Z7ki1PGVQ9lpGWA
DESCRIPTION:Start your Sunday with a refreshing beginner Pilates session o
 n the front lawn of Turnbull Winery\, surrounded by vineyard views and sum
 mer sunshine. Take a deep breath\, stretch beneath the Napa Valley sky\, a
 nd start your Sunday surrounded by the beauty of Turnbull.\n\nMorning Flow
  begins with a 50-minute mat Pilates class on our front lawn\, surrounded 
 by vineyard views and summer sunshine. After class\, we'll gather for brun
 ch bites and a curated selection of Turnbull wines—the perfect way to ea
 se into the rest of your day.\n\nWhether you're a seasoned Pilates enthusi
 ast or trying it for the first time\, this event is all about slowing down
 \, connecting\, and enjoying a beautiful summer morning in wine country. 
 \n\nPlease bring your own mat and towel\, along with comfortable clothing 
 suitable for movement and the morning weather.\n\nSpace is limited\; we en
 courage you to reserve your spot early.
LOCATION:Turnbull Winery
URL:https://store.turnbullwines.com/product/detail/wine-and-wellness-2026/
  
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Unplugged Sundays at Cuvaison
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T130000
