UID:260707YvjRFuVn0EuyUuw5vNTuaw
DESCRIPTION:July's craft will be sun printing\, also known as cyanotypes. 
 We will provide materials\, but if you have any meaningful or interesting 
 objects you'd like to try making prints with\, feel free to bring them alo
 ng! Are you interested in learning new crafts? Working on setting and meet
 ing new goals? Meeting other like-minded people and making new friends? We
 lcome to the Crafters Society! The Crafters Society is a new\, monthly cra
 ft club specifically aimed at adults between the ages of 18-35 who are int
 erested in flexing their creative muscles\, setting new goals\, and lookin
 g to approach life more mindfully. Each monthly session will include a the
 med craft project\, opportunities to reflect on new and past goals\, and t
 ime to socialize and meet new people. Come join us on this creative advent
 ure! We look forward to meeting you! Registration encouraged\; limited sup
 plies available.
