DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T150000
UID:260520bI0jeet3-ky4lRB-mPuDRA
DESCRIPTION:Read to a Dog Come and read out loud to the dogs of PALS \\(Pa
 ws as Loving Support\\). These well-trained dogs love to listen to stories
  in English and Spanish. Children build confidence in their reading skills
  by reading aloud in a safe space. Occurs 2nd and 4th Sundays of the month
 .
