BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pasadena Bead & Design Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T170000
UID:260626YGI7dfkrLUmvhyI_k1SleQ
DESCRIPTION:Pasadena Bead & Design Show Returns July 31–August 2\n\nPasa
 dena\, CA — The Pasadena Bead & Design Show returns to the Pasadena Conv
 ention Center July 31–August 2\, welcoming the public to a vibrant marke
 tplace of beads\, gemstones\, artisan jewelry\, textiles\, artwear\, findi
 ngs\, handcrafted works\, and creative materials. Held in Pasadena since 2
 008\, the biannual show brings together over 300 exhibitors including stud
 io artists\, tradespeople\, artisans\, and creative suppliers from across 
 the country.\n\nA Marketplace for Designers\, Collectors & Makers\n\nThe P
 asadena Bead & Design Show is a cornerstone West Coast event for artists\,
  designers\, collectors\, and creative businesses seeking distinctive mate
 rials\, artisan craftsmanship\, and creative inspiration. Attendees will d
 iscover an expansive selection of handcrafted jewelry\, hand-cut gemstones
 \, lampwork glass beads\, wearable art\, painted silks\, eco-dyed textiles
 \, mixed-media works\, artisan clothing\, pearls\, natural fibers\, hill t
 ribe silver\, tools\, specialty supplies\, and unique materials for creati
 ve projects.\n\nExpanded Marketplace Offerings\n\nIn addition to its long-
 standing focus on beads\, jewelry\, gemstones\, and artisan materials\, th
 e show will feature select vintage and antique exhibits offering jewelry\,
  textiles\, collectibles\, and other unique finds. These exhibits add anot
 her layer of discovery to an already diverse creative marketplace.\n\nArti
 san Craft\, Design & Creative Community\n\nExhibitors represent a broad ra
 nge of artisan work—from traditional beadwork and lapidary arts to handc
 rafted jewelry\, textiles\, mixed media\, and contemporary craft. The show
  highlights quality materials\, creative process\, and the skill of makers
  working across both traditional and modern forms of design.\n\nHands-On W
 orkshops & Demonstrations\n\nIn addition to shopping\, the show offers a s
 election of hands-on workshops and live demonstrations throughout the week
 end. Attendees can participate in classes and creative experiences in jewe
 lry design\, wire techniques\, metalwork\, mixed media\, clay\, painting\,
  and other artistic disciplines taught by experienced instructors. Worksho
 ps are open to all skill levels and provide an engaging environment for le
 arning\, experimentation\, and creativity.\n\nA Gathering Place for the Cr
 eative Community\n\nSince its inception in 2008\, the Pasadena Bead & Desi
 gn Show has grown into a beloved gathering place for the creative communit
 y—where artists reconnect\, new makers discover their craft\, collectors
  uncover rare finds\, and visitors experience the artistry and process beh
 ind creative work.\n\nGuests are encouraged to connect with artists\, arti
 sans\, and exhibitors\, explore the stories behind the work\, and discover
  a marketplace filled with creativity\, craftsmanship\, and inspiration. W
 hether shopping for distinctive pieces\, sourcing materials\, discovering 
 new artists\, or learning a new skill\, the Pasadena Bead & Design Show of
 fers an immersive and inspiring summer experience.\n\nEvent Details\n\nDat
 es: July 31–August 2\, 2026 Hours: 10am–5pm \\(Friday–Sunday\\) Loca
 tion: Pasadena Convention Center 300 E Green St\, Pasadena\, CA 91101\n\nT
 ickets: $8 online / $10 at the door \\(valid all three days\\)\n\nMore Inf
 ormation\, Exhibitor Applications & Workshop Registration: BeadAndDesign.c
 om
LOCATION:Pasadena Convention Center
URL:https://www.beadanddesign.com/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Imaginists present: BEACHED
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T213000
UID:260625thiawqLNjE6syKSCdOfp-w
DESCRIPTION:A new play by G.B. Lindsay.\n\nOld friends\, Jaycoen \\(Stephe
 n K Patterson\\) and Ougein \\(GB Lindsay\\) wake up to another delightful
  day at the beach as ocean sings and war rages on. But Today enters like n
 o other Yesterday\, for this day has arrived with new twisted turns and bu
 rns\, tucked-up into its sun-worn sleeves. Enter six extraordinary beings 
 \\(mostly Taylor Diffenderfer\\) who will test the limits of their friends
 hip and the inevitability of their fate.\n\nBeached is an absurdist tragic
 omedy in the tradition of Laurel and Hardy\, Beckett\, Kafka\, Tom Stoppar
 d\, and Eric Overmyer.
LOCATION:The Imaginists
URL:https://theimaginists.org/beached-julyaug
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
