 he ideas and processes shaping contemporary metalwork.  The discussion off
 ers a rare opportunity to hear directly from the artists about how they na
 vigate the balance between discipline and innovation. Through dialogue and
  audience questions\, the conversation will reveal the diverse ways artist
 s are pushing the boundaries of metalwork while honoring its deep craft tr
 aditions\, illuminating how these works carry both personal and collective
