SUMMARY:STEAM UP! Sturgeons Mill Historic Steam Powered Sawmill!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T150000
UID:2607070sXDnu8ookSEfR6nqItClg
DESCRIPTION:Steam Up! Sturgeons Mill\, a 100 yr old Historic Steam Powered
  Sawmill will open its gates Aug. 1 & 2 for our Public Demonstration Weeke
 nd. Watch the historic working museum come to life as redwood logs are mil
 led into lumber and slabs. Enjoy the sweet smell of wood smoke and plumes 
 of steam as they are hurled skyward and the sounds of the sawmill radiate 
 throughout a secluded redwood canyon. Docent tours will lead you through C
 alifornia Sawmill History as you venture the beautiful grounds of the sawm
 ill and woodland gardens. Open 10:00 - 3:00 each day with lunch available 
 to purchase in our beautiful picnic grounds while listening to a local Uku
 lele Band. Free\, donations appreciated as we are a all volunteer non-prof
 it organization. For more info visit our website\, Sturgeonsmill.com.
LOCATION:Sturgeons Mill
