SUMMARY:Gloria Ferrer 40th Anniversary
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T160000
UID:260707KI2AufqPg0W1eSGg9J1Eqg
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate  Gloria Ferrer's 40th Anniversary with a festive day
  at Willow Springs featuring exceptional wines\, culinary delights\, live 
 music\, and special experiences throughout the estate. Guests can sip and 
 savor award-winning wines while enjoying exclusive behind-the-scenes semin
 ars led by Gloria Ferrer's Directors of Winemaking\, Vineyard\, and Produc
 tion\, offering a rare look into the craftsmanship behind every bottle. Se
 t against the beauty of the vineyard\, this anniversary celebration is an 
 opportunity to relax\, connect\, and honor four decades of sparkling winem
 aking excellence. Join fellow wine lovers for a memorable day filled with 
