DESCRIPTION:Family Day at Robert Ferguson Observatory is a fun\, education
 al experience designed for families with children ages 12 and under. Guest
 s explore the wonders of the solar system through hands-on activities\, in
 teractive learning stations\, and engaging outdoor discovery focused on pl
 anets and the Sun. This special program encourages curiosity about astrono
 my and our cosmic neighborhood in an accessible\, family-friendly setting.
  Advanced tickets are required\, attendance is limited\, and each group mu
 st be accompanied by at least one adult chaperone. A State Park parking fe
 e applies upon arrival. Because part of the program is outdoors\, visitors
  are encouraged to bring sun protection\, water\, and hats. Families may a
 lso enjoy the nearby picnic area before activities begin\, making it a ful
 l day of learning\, exploration\, and celestial adventure.
LOCATION:Robert Ferguson Observatory
